  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おまえ……逃げるなんて、カッコ悪いぞ！\n正々堂々、オレたちと戦えっ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "スーツ着て、怖い顔して、周りの人ビビらせてさ。\nそりゃ、スゲー偉いやつなんだろーけど……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "上手くできないかもしんねーのに、\nそれでもやるって言ったオレたちのほうが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "頑張るって言ったなおの方が、おまえなんかより、\n何百倍も強くてカッコいいからな！　だから……！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お前、もしかして315プロダクションの……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "志狼くん、どうかしましたか！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサー！　かのん、なお……。\nひっく、ス、スタッフさんまで……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "オレ……ひっく。ごめん、●●●●プロデューサー。\nすっげームカついて、おっきい声出しちゃった……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "大丈夫ですよ、志狼くん。大丈夫です。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あの……男極の件で、主催者の回答待ちになっている\n件がいくつかあるんですが、どうすれば……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "男極スタッフ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええい、知るか、いちいち私の指示を仰ぐなっ！\nお前たちスタッフで判断すればいいだろう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "で、でも、責任者が決めてくれないと。\nみんな不安で、誰も仕事を進められませんよ……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "男極スタッフ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 26
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それなら、アイドルに責任を取らせればいい。\nオモテに出るのはアイドルなんだからな！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_h:step-28:text",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 30,
          "target_step_index": 27
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あ、あのっ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
